Payment lifecycle, PostgreSQL guards, request replay and integration-testing behavior were adapted from UBB, Apache-2.0. CAP changes these implementations and keeps UBB separate.

x402 protocol types and Solidity ABI artifacts: x402-rs 2.0.2, Apache-2.0, commit 0b14f39afb604a7df25b3496ba34122bdca45a7f.
